| MIDISynthTests: set-up shared by the test Obey files (not run on its own)
Set MSTest$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Set MSTest$Out <MSTest$Dir>.Results
| The SoundFont comes from !MIDISynth: it must have been seen or run.
If "<MIDISynth$SoundFont>" = "" Then Error 0 Please double-click !MIDISynth first (it sets MIDISynth$SoundFont), then run this test again.
| midiplay gets its memory from dynamic areas; this is for the program itself.
